## Capability map

What Oracle CAN do in this instance:

- [x] Answer questions with live NotebookLM context
- [x] Read and update Obsidian session notes
- [x] Draft and read Gmail emails
- [x] Create Google Calendar events
- [x] Autonomous web research (Brave Search)
- [x] Browse and interact with websites (Playwright)
- [x] Receive and send Telegram messages
- [ ] Post to social media (requires n8n)
- [ ] Control desktop (requires MCPControl)
- [ ] Transcribe audio (requires Whisper)
- [ ] Generate images (requires ComfyUI or Replicate)

Adjust this list to match your actual setup.
